{"id":"4210c81cec97e8d36f96432bbb3eb6f6e87a8e0e","url":"https://filmstudio.rxlab.app/","title":"RxFilmStudio — Your film studio, in one window","site_name":"TechURLs","source":"Hacker News","byline":null,"excerpt":"A native macOS app to score, narrate, caption, and render your film — with an agent in the director's chair.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><DIV><header><nav><a href=\"#\"><span>RxFilm<span>Studio</span></span></a></nav></header><div><p>Take 01 — Native macOS</p><div><p>Score, narrate, caption, and render — with an agent sitting in the director’s chair.</p></div></div><div><p><span>01</span><span>Music</span><span></span></p><div><h2>Score it.</h2><p>Generate cues with Lyria. Keep every take in one reel.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"The music workspace, with takes stacked in one reel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2245\" height=\"1218\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=640&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=750&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=828&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=1080&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=1200&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=1920&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=2048&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fprojects.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t\"></p></div></div><div><p><span>02</span><span>Narrative</span><span></span></p><div><h2>Voice it.</h2><p>Multi-speaker narration, tuned line by line.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"Multi-speaker narration being tuned line by line\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2286\" height=\"1244\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=640&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=750&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=828&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=1080&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=1200&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=1920&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=2048&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fnarrative.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t\"></p></div></div><div><p><span>03</span><span>Caption</span><span></span></p><div><h2>Subtitle it.</h2><p>Transcribe, translate, retime. Export VTT or SRT.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"Captions being transcribed, translated and retimed\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1976\" height=\"1145\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=640&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=750&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=828&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=1080&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=1200&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=1920&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=2048&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fcaption.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t\"></p></div></div><div><p><span>04</span><span>Image</span><span></span></p><div><h2>Frame it.</h2><p>Stills and reference art without leaving the app.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"Stills and reference art generated inside the app\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2339\" height=\"1268\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=640&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=750&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=828&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=1080&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=1200&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=1920&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=2048&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimage.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t\"></p></div></div><div><p><span>05</span><span>Remotion</span><span></span></p><div><h2>Render it.</h2><p>A real timeline. 4K, 60 fps, straight out of the app.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"A Remotion composition with a live 4K preview and timeline\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2306\" height=\"1260\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=640&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=750&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=828&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=1080&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=1200&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=1920&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=2048&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fremotion.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t\"></p></div></div><div><p><span>06</span><span>Agent</span><span></span></p><div><h2>Direct it.</h2><p>Ask for a change. Review every edit before it lands.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"The agent panel proposing caption edits for review\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1070\" height=\"1508\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=640&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=750&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=828&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=1080&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=1200&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=1920&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=2048&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fagent.webp&w=3840&q=75&dpl=dpl_7FaVanRDNincTLdNXRx3yS9CPF5t\"></p></div></div><section><h2>Roll camera.</h2></section></DIV></DIV>","content_text":"RxFilmStudioTake 01 — Native macOSScore, narrate, caption, and render — with an agent sitting in the director’s chair.01MusicScore it.Generate cues with Lyria. Keep every take in one reel.02NarrativeVoice it.Multi-speaker narration, tuned line by line.03CaptionSubtitle it.Transcribe, translate, retime. Export VTT or SRT.04ImageFrame it.Stills and reference art without leaving the app.05RemotionRender it.A real timeline. 4K, 60 fps, straight out of the app.06AgentDirect it.Ask for a change. Review every edit before it lands.Roll camera.","fetched_at":"2026-09-24T16:26:23.079Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>Take 01 — Native macOS</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Take 01 — Native macOS","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Score, narrate, caption, and render — with an agent sitting in the director’s chair.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Score, narrate, caption, and render — with an agent sitting in the director’s chair.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>01</span><span>Music</span><span></span></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h2>Score it.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Score it.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Generate cues with Lyria. Keep every take in one reel.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Generate cues with Lyria.","zh":null},{"en":"Keep every take in one reel.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>02</span><span>Narrative</span><span></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"02Narrative","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Voice it.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Voice it.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Multi-speaker narration, tuned line by line.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Multi-speaker narration, tuned line by line.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>03</span><span>Caption</span><span></span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"03Caption","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Subtitle it.</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Subtitle it.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Trans